---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Governance — Xhavic"
  description="On-chain governance with no off-chain backdoors. DAO structure controlling protocol upgrades, sequencer policies, oracle parameters, and treasury."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="section bg-dark text-white" data-reveal>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-400 mb-6">
          <a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a>
          <span>/</span>
          <span class="text-white">Governance</span>
        </nav>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold mb-6">
          <span class="gradient-text-static">On-chain governance.</span><br class="hidden md:block" />
          No off-chain backdoors.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-300 mb-8 max-w-2xl">
          The Xhavic governance layer is a DAO structure with on-chain proposal execution.
          No multisig can override governance decisions. No off-chain committee can veto
          on-chain votes. The protocol is governed by its token holders.
        </p>
        <a href="/docs" class="btn-primary">Read Governance Docs</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- DAO Structure -->
  <section class="section" data-reveal>
    <div class="container max-w-5xl">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title">DAO Structure</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
          Governance is organized as a decentralized autonomous organization with on-chain
          proposal submission, voting, and execution. No component of the governance system
          operates off-chain.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="split-section">
        <!-- Left: Proposal Lifecycle -->
        <div class="accent-card">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-5">Proposal Lifecycle</h3>
          <div class="space-y-5">
            {[
              { step: '1', label: 'Submission', desc: 'Any token holder meeting the proposal threshold can submit a governance proposal on-chain.' },
              { step: '2', label: 'Discussion Period', desc: 'A fixed period for community review and analysis before voting begins.' },
              { step: '3', label: 'Voting', desc: 'Token-weighted voting. One token, one vote. No delegation to off-chain entities.' },
              { step: '4', label: 'Execution', desc: 'Approved proposals execute on-chain automatically. No manual intervention required.' },
            ].map((item) => (
              <div class="flex gap-3">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                  <span class="text-primary text-xs font-bold">{item.step}</span>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm">{item.label}</h4>
                  <p class="text-muted text-sm">{item.desc}</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Right: Design Principles -->
        <div class="accent-card">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-5">Design Principles</h3>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            {[
              'All governance actions execute on-chain. No off-chain multisig can override a passed proposal.',
              'Proposal code is the proposal. What is voted on is what executes — no interpretation layer.',
              'Voting power is proportional to token holdings. No special classes of votes or veto rights.',
              'Timelock delays between approval and execution allow the community to respond to malicious proposals.',
              'The governance contract itself is upgradeable only through governance.',
            ].map((item) => (
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
                <p class="text-muted text-sm">{item}</p>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="footnote text-center mt-6">
        Source: XHAVIC Technical Whitepaper v1.0, Section 13 — Governance Architecture
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Four Governance Domains -->
  <section class="section bg-surface" data-reveal>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title">Four Governance Domains</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
          Governance authority is organized into four distinct domains. Each domain
          has independent proposal and voting processes.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto" data-reveal-stagger>
        <div class="accent-card group" style="--accent-color: #3b82f6;">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-blue-500/10 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-blue-500/20 transition-colors duration-300">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold">Protocol Upgrades</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm">
            Changes to the execution layer, smart contract upgrades, new precompile addresses,
            and modifications to the core protocol logic. Requires supermajority approval.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="accent-card group" style="--accent-color: #6366f1;">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-indigo-500/20 transition-colors duration-300">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold">Sequencer Policies</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm">
            Block time parameters, batch submission windows, MEV protection settings,
            and sequencer rotation rules. Controls how transactions are ordered and submitted.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="accent-card group" style="--accent-color: #8b5cf6;">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-violet-500/10 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-violet-500/20 transition-colors duration-300">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-violet-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold">Oracle Parameters</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm">
            Data source configuration, quorum thresholds, freshness requirements,
            and new price feed additions. Controls the native oracle infrastructure.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="accent-card group" style="--accent-color: #a855f7;">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-purple-500/10 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-purple-500/20 transition-colors duration-300">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 9V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2m2 4h10a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H9a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm7-5a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold">Treasury</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm">
            Protocol treasury allocation, grant funding, ecosystem development budgets,
            and fee distribution parameters. All treasury movements are on-chain.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Progressive Decentralization -->
  <section class="section bg-dark text-white" data-reveal>
    <div class="container max-w-4xl">
      <div class="text-center mb-10 md:mb-14">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold text-white mb-4 tracking-tight">Progressive Decentralization</h2>
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Governance does not launch fully decentralized. The roadmap moves from
          constrained initial governance to full DAO control.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-horizontal" data-reveal-stagger>
        <!-- Phase I -->
        <div class="timeline-h-item">
          <div class="glass-card text-left mt-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Phase I — Foundation</h3>
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-pill bg-primary/20 text-primary">Current</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 mb-3 block">Launch</span>
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              {[
                'Permissioned sequencer operated by the core team',
                'Governance contracts deployed but with limited scope',
                'Community feedback channels active',
                'Token distribution and initial staking',
              ].map((item) => (
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-300">
                  <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
                  {item}
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Phase II -->
        <div class="timeline-h-item">
          <div class="glass-card text-left mt-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Phase II — Activation</h3>
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-pill bg-white/10 text-gray-400">Planned</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 mb-3 block">Q3-Q4 2026</span>
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              {[
                'Full DAO governance activated across all four domains',
                'Multi-sequencer rotation governed by token holders',
                'Treasury governance live',
                'On-chain proposal execution enabled',
              ].map((item) => (
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-300">
                  <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary/50 mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
                  {item}
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Phase III as full-width below -->
      <div class="mt-6" data-reveal>
        <div class="glass-card">
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center gap-2 md:gap-4 mb-3">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Phase III — Maturity</h3>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">2027+</span>
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-pill bg-white/10 text-gray-400">Planned</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-2">
            {[
              'All protocol parameters governed by DAO',
              'No admin keys or emergency multisig',
              'Cross-domain governance coordination',
              'Governance contract upgrades via governance itself',
            ].map((item) => (
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-300">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary/40 mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
                {item}
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-center text-xs text-gray-500 italic mt-6">
        Source: XHAVIC Technical Whitepaper v1.0, Section 13. Timelines are targets and subject to change.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How to Participate -->
  <section class="section" data-reveal>
    <div class="container max-w-3xl">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title">How to Participate</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
          The governance documentation covers proposal formats, voting mechanics,
          domain-specific parameters, and the progressive decentralization timeline.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline timeline-light">
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-1">Acquire XHV Tokens</h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm">
            Governance power is derived from token holdings. Acquire XHV through the token distribution or secondary markets to participate in on-chain voting.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-1">Join the Discussion</h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm">
            Participate in governance discussions on the forum, Discord, and community channels. Understand the proposals and engage with the community before voting.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-1">Submit or Vote on Proposals</h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm">
            Token holders meeting the proposal threshold can submit governance proposals on-chain. All holders can vote. One token, one vote. No delegation to off-chain entities.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-1">Monitor Execution</h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm">
            Approved proposals execute on-chain automatically after the timelock period. Verify that execution matches what was approved. All governance actions are transparent and verifiable.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="footnote text-center mt-4">
        Specific numeric thresholds will be set at governance launch and are themselves governable parameters.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section bg-dark text-white" data-reveal>
    <div class="container text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mb-4">
        <span class="gradient-text-static">Learn More About Governance</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300 mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">
        The governance documentation covers proposal formats, voting mechanics,
        domain-specific parameters, and the progressive decentralization timeline.
      </p>
      <a href="/docs" class="btn-primary">
        Read Governance Docs
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script>import '../scripts/reveal.ts';</script>
</BaseLayout>
